flowchart TD
    A[作者提交 JSON schema] --> B[ConfigPipeline 合并]
    B --> C{schema/record 校验}
    C -->|通过| D[DataSchemaRegistry]
    C -->|失败| E[启动失败并报告字段路径]
    D --> F[PanelProjectionReader]
    G[GraphOutputValueStore] --> F
    F --> H{pin source}
    H -->|data| I[JsonNode 结构化值]
    H -->|graph| J[float/int/bool 图输出]
    I --> K[PanelVariableSet]
    J --> K
    K --> L[Native/Web skin]
    H -->|缺失 data path| M[明确报错]
